  "description": "An analyst has finished creating charts in a Quick Sight analysis and wants to give business users a shared, interactive view without granting them permission to edit the analysis. What should the analyst publish?",
  "main": "<nav class=\"breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"현재 위치\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>퀴즈</span></nav><section class=\"quiz-page\"><div class=\"quiz-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">QUESTION 107</p><h1>퀴즈</h1></div><strong>107 / 108</strong></div><div class=\"quiz-progress\" aria-label=\"107번째 문제\"><span style=\"width:99%\"></span></div><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q107\" data-question=\"Q107\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"1\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q107</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An analyst has finished creating charts in a Quick Sight analysis and wants to give business users a shared, interactive view without granting them permission to edit the analysis. What should the analyst publish?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q107\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">An Amazon Machine Image</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q107\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">A dashboard</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q107\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">A VPC route table</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q107\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">An EBS volume</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · 분석(<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#analyses-sheets-and-visuals\">analysis</a>)을 대시보드로 게시해 사용자 또는 그룹에 공유한다. 대시보드 열람자는 필터 등으로 상호작용할 수 있지만 원본 분석을 직접 편집하지 않는다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/\">QuickSight / Quick Sight</a></div></article><nav class=\"sequence\" aria-label=\"문제 이동\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q106/\">이전 문제 <b>Q106</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q108/\">다음 문제 <b>Q108</b></a></span></nav><p class=\"save-note\">선택과 채점 결과는 이 브라우저에 자동 저장됩니다.</p></section>"
